# r1112 group B (prep with spawn-animals=true: false removes summoned animals, SQ-OB-09 r1112 first pass): corrected reruns of r1111 bw batch faults (verdicts bw.md). World: fresh NORMAL world, seed 8675309,
# structures on (prep_srv.sh group B defaults), same world as r1111 bw, so the Heap is again at -10 108 -2 in the Nether.
